Dialogue: 99,0:00:38.60,0:00:39.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aceea este?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:40.77,0:00:42.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aceea este Planeta Sfântă?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:35.57,0:03:37.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu sunt Kahm.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.36,0:03:39.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu cine ești?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:40.24,0:03:41.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,K-Kahm?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:43.16,0:03:44.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poți vorbi limba noastră?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:45.16,0:03:47.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ne-am sărutat mai \Ndevreme, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.46,0:03:49.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci acum poți \Nînțelege limba noastră.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:18.32,0:04:21.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se pare că te-ai trezit, \Ndragul nostru oaspete.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:22.07,0:04:23.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oaspete?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:24.99,0:04:26.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu se poate!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:28.41,0:04:30.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt în spațiu!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:30.04,0:04:31.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa este!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:36.63,0:04:40.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Înțeleg. Deci am fost \Nrăpit de acea fată.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:40.05,0:04:44.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Răpit? Ce idee absurdă!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:44.97,0:04:49.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se pare că prințesa \Na prins drag de tine!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:49.56,0:04:51.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prințesa?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:51.02,0:04:52.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:52.06,0:04:56.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prințesa Kahm a Imperiului \NSfântului Evascuraze.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:56.28,0:04:59.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sfântul Evascuraze?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:59.40,0:05:01.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prințesa Kahm?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:06.95,0:05:08.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mă atingeți!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.79,0:05:12.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba! Nu-mi pasă dacă e \Nprințesă sau orice altceva...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:12.58,0:05:15.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce aveți de gând \Nsă faceți cu mine?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:20.55,0:05:25.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bun. Am pregătit o cină specială \Npentru dragul nostru oaspete.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:25.68,0:05:27.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aceasta este soția mea, Momo.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:27.43,0:05:30.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nimeni nu se pricepe mai \Nbine decât soția mea
Dialogue: 99,0:05:30.18,0:05:34.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,la prepararea unei mese care \Nsă-ți mărească virilitatea.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.61,0:05:35.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-i așa, Momo?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:37.69,0:05:40.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, încetează, dragule!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:41.07,0:05:42.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haide, mănâncă tot!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:46.08,0:05:47.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,V-Vreți să mănânc {\i1}asta{\i0}?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:49.95,0:05:54.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,V-am spus că voi veți mânca mai târziu, copii neastâpărați!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:55.33,0:05:59.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, eu trebuie să merg \Ns-o ajut pe prințesă cu ținuta ei.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:59.80,0:06:01.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Va fi prima ei \Nnoapte matrimonială,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:01.51,0:06:05.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,deci trebuie s-o învăț obiceiurile \Ncelor din Imperiul Sfântului Evascuraze.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:06.01,0:06:07.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,P-Prima noapte matrimonială?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:07.97,0:06:09.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Urmează să se căsătorească?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:15.69,0:06:17.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, ești așa de amuzant!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.19,0:06:21.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirele se preface că nu știe!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:21.61,0:06:23.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E-Eu sunt mirele?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:37.29,0:06:42.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și este destul de bine \Nînzestrat acolo jos, Prințesă.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.30,0:06:46.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum, câteva lucruri \Nimportante de reținut...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:46.80,0:06:50.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O soție nu trebuie niciodată \Nsă-și facă de râs soțul!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:50.26,0:06:52.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și, orice ar fi, trebuie \Nsă-i fie mereu alături!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:53.56,0:06:55.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să-i fiu mereu alături, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:55.85,0:06:58.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Există o tehnică \Nspecială pentru asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:58.69,0:07:00.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sau, cel puțin, \Nasta mi-a spus Battia.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:00.32,0:07:04.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și trebuie să-i ofere \Npace și liniște soțului ei!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:04.82,0:07:07.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, da. Înțeleg, înțeleg.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:07.82,0:07:09.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:09.24,0:07:12.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta vrem noi să-i facem \Nsă creadă, Prințesă.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:14.91,0:07:18.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ca femei, trebuie să \Nne jucăm rolul bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:18.58,0:07:22.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bărbații sunt ușor de \Npăcălit cu un simplu zâmbet.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:22.38,0:07:25.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unde-i punem, acolo stau.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:25.17,0:07:29.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vor mânca toată \Nmâncarea pe care le-o dăm.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:29.14,0:07:31.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și vor vrea să facem \Ncopii încontinuu.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:32.39,0:07:36.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oricum, bărbații sunt \Nniște creaturi jalnice.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:39.06,0:07:42.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sună așa de complicat.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:42.40,0:07:45.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apropo, asta va fi prima \Nvoastră noapte împreună.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:45.90,0:07:50.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trebuie să recunosc că \Nsunt puțin îngrijorată.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:54.16,0:07:55.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:55.29,0:07:59.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu v-am spus să ciocăniți la ușă \Nînainte să intrați în camerele prințesei?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:00.00,0:08:01.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poftim?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:02.04,0:08:03.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Ce s-a întâmplat?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:14.72,0:08:16.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vrei să te trimitem \Nînapoi pe Pământ?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:16.89,0:08:19.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești prost cumva?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:19.85,0:08:23.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Cum îndrăznești să mă \Nfaci prost, invadatoareo!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:24.53,0:08:26.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-Invadatoare?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:27.11,0:08:29.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exagerezi un pic!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:29.07,0:08:32.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În primul rând, voi sunteți invadatorii \Ncare au pus stăpânire pe Planeta Sfântă!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:32.95,0:08:34.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poftim?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:36.83,0:08:39.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-mi pasă. Trimite-mă \Nînapoi pe Pământ!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:39.12,0:08:40.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Altfel...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:40.58,0:08:42.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Altfel ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:43.79,0:08:45.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu te apropia de mine!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:45.71,0:08:48.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și trimite-mă înapoi pe Pământ!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:50.22,0:08:52.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dragul meu soț!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:53.68,0:08:56.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești așa de prost!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:59.06,0:09:00.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Auci!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:02.77,0:09:05.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, mă bucur așa \Nde tare că ești bine!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:11.78,0:09:15.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba. Nu știu ce fel de \Ntruc a mai fost și ăsta, dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:26.88,0:09:28.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:28.17,0:09:29.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fie.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:30.38,0:09:32.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă nu mă placi...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:33.26,0:09:34.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta este.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:34.09,0:09:37.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai, ei bine, nu am spus asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:38.43,0:09:41.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prințesă...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:41.64,0:09:45.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Când mă gândesc \Ncă faci toate astea
Dialogue: 99,0:09:45.23,0:09:48.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,deoarece vrei să-i salvezi pe oamenii de pe Planeta Sfântă...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:48.78,0:09:51.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Planeta Sfântă?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:51.36,0:09:54.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te referi la planeta Pământ?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:54.49,0:09:55.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exact.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:55.78,0:10:00.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se pare că împăratul vrea să curețe acea planetă de oameni.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.29,0:10:03.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar dacă prințesa se \Nva căsători cu tine,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:03.79,0:10:08.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,acesta va fi nevoit \Nsă se răzgândească.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:08.67,0:10:09.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Înțelegi?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.43,0:10:21.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E vina ta!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:21.64,0:10:22.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa este.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:27.86,0:10:28.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:35.74,0:10:37.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Battia!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.08,0:10:40.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Când ai ajuns aici?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:40.49,0:10:42.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ne-am văzut de mult.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:42.04,0:10:44.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mă lua cu asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:44.83,0:10:47.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te-am căutat peste tot.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:48.25,0:10:51.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă gândeam eu că te-ai \Nîndrăgostit de vreun pămpălău.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:52.88,0:10:56.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu vorbești?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:58.22,0:11:00.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aceea este Battia, \Nprietena ei cea mai bună.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:01.22,0:11:04.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar, Kahm, nu prea știu ce să \Nzic despre această maimuță.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:06.48,0:11:07.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maimuță?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:07.94,0:11:09.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crezi că împăratul \Nva fi de acord cu ea?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:10.90,0:11:13.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Împăratul nu înțelege \Nce vrei tu să faci.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:13.69,0:11:17.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ba chiar mi-a cerut să te caut.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:17.16,0:11:19.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-ai vreme de pierdut cu \No maimuță proastă ca el.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:20.28,0:11:23.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce atâta grabă? Vreau să \Nfac lucrurile în ritmul meu.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:23.45,0:11:25.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oricum, nu l-am mai \Nvăzut pe tata de trei luni.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.08,0:11:29.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce fel de relație părinte-copil \Nexistă între ei doi?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:30.50,0:11:32.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crezi că poți fugi de împărat?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:32.05,0:11:34.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu ești singura lui fiică!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:34.34,0:11:38.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cel cu care te căsătorești va da \Nmoștenitorul Imperiului Sfântului Evascuraze.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:40.64,0:11:42.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trebuie doar să \Nmă căsătoresc, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:44.35,0:11:46.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-mi spune că \Nvrei s-o faci cu el.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:47.90,0:11:49.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E un mare pămpălău!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:49.73,0:11:51.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E încet la minte \Nși mai e și scund.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.82,0:11:53.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai arată și ca un \Nadevărat pervers.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:53.40,0:11:56.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oricum, ce ai văzut \Nla acea maimuță?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:56.78,0:11:59.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai lasă-mă în pace!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:59.24,0:12:01.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cel ales de tata e \Nun mare dobitoc!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:01.70,0:12:03.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vezi tu...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:03.04,0:12:05.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu vreau să-mi petrec viața \Ncu dobitocul ales de el!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:05.87,0:12:09.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Urăsc când altcineva \Nîncearcă să decidă...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:09.67,0:12:11.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,cu cine mă voi căsători!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:11.34,0:12:13.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,K-Kahm...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:19.84,0:12:24.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Un cavaler ca mine... \Nnu se va lăsa păcălit așa de ușor.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:28.94,0:12:31.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Datoria unei soții este...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:31.06,0:12:32.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am uitat... Îmi mai \Npoți spune o dată, Momo?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:32.86,0:12:33.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, da.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:33.82,0:12:36.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O soție trebuie să-i fie \Nmereu alături soțului ei.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:36.36,0:12:39.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, asta. Îi voi fi \Nalături soțului meu.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:39.15,0:12:41.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și nu vei putea să mă oprești.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:43.45,0:12:44.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doamne...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:44.91,0:12:47.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce nu-ți poți găsi \Nun bărbat adevărat?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:47.83,0:12:50.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ia mai lasă-mă! \NCe știi tu despre bărbați?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:53.17,0:12:54.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vorbește virgina.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:54.71,0:12:57.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și tu te comporți ca o virgină!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:02.39,0:13:03.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:03.60,0:13:06.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu vă luptați între voi!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:26.58,0:13:28.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, vai!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:28.79,0:13:30.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mai bagă în tine!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:33.88,0:13:38.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kahm se luptă pentru mine?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:38.17,0:13:40.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pe bune?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:10.66,0:14:15.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nătângule. Chiar credeai \Ncă aș răni-o pe Kahm?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:15.79,0:14:19.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa mai facem noi \Ndin când în când.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:19.42,0:14:20.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, serios?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:23.26,0:14:27.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm, bănuiesc că te-ai îndrăgostit de \Nel la prima vedere, ca o virgină ce ești.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:27.85,0:14:30.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar ești liberă să faci ce dorești.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.60,0:14:33.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce-ați zice să sărbătorim \Ncu ceva de băut?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:33.89,0:14:34.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:35.02,0:14:37.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt sigură că asta îl va scoate din pepeni pe împărat!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:37.94,0:14:39.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Probabil va fi \Nnegru de supărare.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:39.90,0:14:43.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu va mai putea face nimic \Ndacă ne-am culcat deja.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:46.70,0:14:49.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu cred că va fi atât de simplu.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:50.95,0:14:53.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vom vedea când \Nva veni momentul.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:53.83,0:14:55.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, stai o secundă, Kahm...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:55.54,0:14:57.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poate ar trebui să te mai \Ngândești puțin la asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:57.71,0:15:01.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar crezi că un pământean \Nși o evascurazeană pot face...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:01.80,0:15:03.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, știi tu la ce mă refer...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:12.39,0:15:13.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De fapt, nu cred că \Nva fi vreo problemă!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:15.52,0:15:17.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prostule!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:21.36,0:15:23.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Ce e asta? \NCe naiba se aude?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:23.61,0:15:26.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-ți face griji. E doar \No avertizare de proximitate.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:26.49,0:15:28.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Înseamnă că se \Napropie cineva de noi.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:32.37,0:15:34.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cred că ar trebui \Nsă-ți faci griji, Kahm.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:34.91,0:15:38.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bătrânul tău drag e pe \Ncale să-și facă apariția.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:38.50,0:15:39.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:46.84,0:15:48.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta e nasol!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:48.84,0:15:50.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E bătrânul Progres.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:53.27,0:15:55.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Împăratul a ajuns la \Napogeul puterii sale,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:55.77,0:15:57.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,dar nu are niciun \Nmoștenitor încă.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:57.31,0:16:00.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În plus, își face griji neîncetat \Npentru fiica sa cea neastâmpărată.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:00.98,0:16:03.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă o voi putea \Naduce înapoi pe Kahm,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.48,0:16:05.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,statutul meu în imperiu \Nse va îmbunătăți.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:10.70,0:16:13.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Ce înseamnă asta, Prințesă?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:13.74,0:16:15.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai întâi, vă strecurați \Nprintre navele flotei mele,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:15.95,0:16:17.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,iar apoi aterizați \Npe Planeta Sfântă.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:17.96,0:16:19.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În plus, această creatură...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:19.92,0:16:21.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E o maimuță, \Ndupă cum poți vedea...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:21.96,0:16:23.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Comandant al Flotei, \Ndomnule Progres.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:23.84,0:16:24.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-mi mai spune așa.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:26.34,0:16:31.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar să știi că voi lua asupra mea \Nîntreaga furie a împăratului, Prințesă.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:31.26,0:16:34.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mare păcat, dar bănuiesc \Ncă asta e treaba ta.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:34.85,0:16:36.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Totuși...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:36.60,0:16:39.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pare că ai un plan \Nsecret pus la cale.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:47.53,0:16:50.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, avem toate datele \Npe care le-ai adunat,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:50.74,0:16:54.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,așa că ne vom întoarce \Nimediat în imperiu.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.86,0:17:26.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hopa! Îmi cer scuze pentru asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:26.40,0:17:29.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am apăsat puțin prea tare pedala de \Naccelerație și am pierdut controlul navei.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:30.15,0:17:31.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Geobaldi?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:32.28,0:17:34.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ai fost în stare să-ți \Ncontrolezi nava, Geobaldi?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:34.99,0:17:38.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cum naiba a ajuns \Ncineva ca tine comandant?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:38.37,0:17:39.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai puțin.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:39.87,0:17:44.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nava mea nu e ca a ta, făcută doar ca să patruleze \Nîn jurul împăratului.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:44.71,0:17:48.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nava mea e mult mai energică \Nși plină de personalitate.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:48.96,0:17:51.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Ce naiba tot spui acolo?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:51.38,0:17:55.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești doar un parvenit care nici măcar nu \Ne în stare să-și conducă propria navă!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:56.35,0:18:00.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai grijă ce spui, \Ndomnule Progres.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:00.14,0:18:03.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nici măcar împăratul nu e \Nîn stare să vadă până aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:03.40,0:18:06.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă ai fi găsit mort, \Nplutind prin spațiu,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.40,0:18:08.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nu se va afla niciodată \Ncine ți-a venit de hac.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:10.90,0:18:11.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Privește.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:11.99,0:18:15.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Toate femeile frumoase, \Ninclusiv prințesa Kahm,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:15.07,0:18:17.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,sunt de partea mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:17.99,0:18:19.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești un prost.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:20.12,0:18:22.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ajunge, Geobaldi.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:23.50,0:18:25.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dă-te jos de pe noi!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:26.42,0:18:30.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar dacă te vei sui \Ntu pe mine după, Battia.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:31.92,0:18:32.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perversule.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:44.35,0:18:47.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce se va întâmpla \Ncu mine acum?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:53.28,0:18:56.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, ai terminat deja?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:57.66,0:18:59.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt frânt.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:59.37,0:19:00.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doamne...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:00.91,0:19:05.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum câteva momente spuneai \Ncă vei rupe patul cu mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:05.33,0:19:06.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Auci!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:14.30,0:19:17.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Când am făcut-o prima oară?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:17.84,0:19:19.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cine mai știe.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:19.22,0:19:21.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ți se potrivește \Nsă fii melancolică.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:21.26,0:19:24.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am făcut sex ultima \Noară acum vreo șase luni.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:24.81,0:19:27.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu era intenția mea \Nsă fiu melancolică.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:27.27,0:19:28.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar că...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:29.06,0:19:34.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu nu am simțit niciodată \Nceea ce simte Kahm acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:35.20,0:19:37.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta e tot.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:38.07,0:19:39.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:39.24,0:19:40.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu e cumva numai \Nvina ta pentru asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:40.78,0:19:42.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Battia...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:42.29,0:19:46.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am uitat să-ți spun, \Ndar Progres este sub pat.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:46.87,0:19:47.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:56.72,0:19:58.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nici să nu încerci...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:58.84,0:20:01.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Geobaldi, mai e ceva până ajunge
Dialogue: 99,0:20:01.60,0:20:05.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,în Imperiul Sfântului Evascuraze.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:05.64,0:20:07.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, hei... Battia!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:13.65,0:20:18.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, vă voi lăsa \Nsă fiți singuri acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:21.20,0:20:23.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să nu-i deranjăm! \NSă nu-i deranjăm!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:30.83,0:20:34.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, hei, la ce te gândești \Nîn acest moment?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:34.46,0:20:36.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, la nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:37.30,0:20:39.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar nu mă gândesc \Nla absolut nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.18,0:20:46.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De fapt, mă gândesc la faptul că soarta \NPământului se află pe umerii mei...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:50.56,0:20:54.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Stai! Asta nu înseamnă \Ncă nu sunt interesat de tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:54.23,0:20:55.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar că...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:16.42,0:21:19.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă-mi vei frânge inima, \Nte voi urî pentru tot restul vieții mele.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:43.91,0:21:45.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce se petrece?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:45.03,0:21:46.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa fac sex oamenii?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:48.66,0:21:50.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să nu-i deranjăm! \NSă nu-i deranjăm!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:05.89,0:22:07.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu se poate! Am ajuns \Ndeja la destinație?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:07.93,0:22:10.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce naiba... Nici măcar nu \Nam apucat să facem ceva!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:49.70,0:23:51.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haide. Prezintă-te.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:51.70,0:23:55.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E-E-Ei bine, d-domnule Împărat...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:55.12,0:23:58.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E-Eu sunt Wakatsuki Tetsuya...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:58.25,0:23:59.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am 19 ani...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:59.25,0:24:01.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și sunt fotograf.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:01.63,0:24:03.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Încă virgin.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:03.17,0:24:04.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te rog, tată!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:04.84,0:24:07.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te rog să nu-i ataci pe oamenii \Ncare trăiesc pe Planeta Sfântă!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:13.31,0:24:14.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:16.31,0:24:18.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya este logodnicul meu!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:22.86,0:24:25.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci te rog să nu distrugi \Nplaneta lui Tetsuya.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:42.21,0:24:45.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Cine naiba sunteți voi? \NLăsați-mă! Dați-mi drumul!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:45.96,0:24:47.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Dați-mi drumul!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:47.80,0:24:49.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îl vreau executat!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:50.72,0:24:51.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Executat?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:51.59,0:24:54.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Dați-mi drumul, \Nnemernicilor! Hei, așteptați!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:54.56,0:24:55.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am ceva de spus!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:55.85,0:24:58.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, voi doi! \NDați-i drumul!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:58.06,0:24:59.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă ordon!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:59.60,0:25:00.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:04.98,0:25:07.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ajunge.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:07.15,0:25:09.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm! Nu asta a fost \Nceea ce am vorbit!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:09.45,0:25:11.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cum ai putut să mă minți?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:11.16,0:25:15.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba! Măcar o dată! Lăsați-mă să mă \Nculc cu ea măcar o dată înainte să mor!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:15.62,0:25:18.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu vreau să mor virgin!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:18.66,0:25:22.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu ești prințesa moștenitoare a \NImperiului Sfântului Evascuraze.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:22.67,0:25:24.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nici gând!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:26.67,0:25:30.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu voi face mereu \Nceea ce vrei tu!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:31.26,0:25:32.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu fi egoistă!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:33.30,0:25:35.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu sunt egoistă?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:35.01,0:25:37.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu ești cel care le \Nspune altora ce să facă.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:37.52,0:25:40.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu ești mult mai \Negoist decât mine!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:40.69,0:25:43.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mai spune nimic! Eu voi \Ndecide cu cine te vei căsători!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:43.52,0:25:46.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu! Nu! Nu! Nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:46.57,0:25:49.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu voi alege singură!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:49.53,0:25:51.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nimeni nu-mi va \Nspune ce să fac!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:52.24,0:25:53.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:53.57,0:25:56.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cere-ți scuze împăratului.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:56.24,0:25:57.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La o parte!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:57.41,0:26:00.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar visezi urât.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:00.29,0:26:04.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Faptul că te căsătorești cu acel \Nvierme e doar în imaginația ta.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:04.67,0:26:05.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ia ascultă aici...
Dialogue: 99,0:26:06.38,0:26:10.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îți știu întregul plan secret.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:10.67,0:26:13.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sigur nu vrei să-i spun tatei...
Dialogue: 99,0:26:13.38,0:26:14.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,așa că mișcă-ți fundul!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:17.68,0:26:18.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La o parte!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:39.41,0:26:40.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te{\alpha&HFF&}tsuya...
Dialogue: 99,0:26:40.41,0:26:41.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsu{\alpha&HFF&}ya...
Dialogue: 99,0:26:41.12,0:26:41.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya...
Dialogue: 99,0:27:10.19,0:27:11.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haide sus!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:14.61,0:27:15.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu ești...
Dialogue: 99,0:27:15.78,0:27:16.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haide, repede!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:18.45,0:27:19.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ai voie aici!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:22.91,0:27:24.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, da?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:37.30,0:27:39.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Impresionant.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:39.68,0:27:40.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:44.64,0:27:45.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:55.70,0:27:57.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya...
Dialogue: 99,0:27:57.41,0:27:58.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești în viață!
Dialogue: 99,0:28:06.37,0:28:07.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce tot faci?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:07.79,0:28:09.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt doar puțin amețit.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:09.67,0:28:12.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar ești un pervers?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:12.96,0:28:14.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt doar un tip obișnuit!
Dialogue: 99,0:28:20.22,0:28:22.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya! Îți mulțumesc!
Dialogue: 99,0:28:29.10,0:28:32.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îi voi da o lecție tatălui meu!
Dialogue: 99,0:28:52.75,0:28:53.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haide s-o facem.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:54.92,0:28:55.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:57.34,0:28:58.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haide să fugim.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:00.13,0:29:01.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să fugim?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:01.43,0:29:02.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:02.89,0:29:04.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ca să ne putem bucura de...
Dialogue: 99,0:29:05.06,0:29:07.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,iubirea noastră interzisă!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:09.19,0:29:10.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ușurel, porumbeilor.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:10.77,0:29:12.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Veți avea timp de asta mai târziu.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:12.56,0:29:14.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grăbiți-vă odată. Doamne...
Dialogue: 99,0:29:14.90,0:29:16.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trebuie să plecăm repede.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:16.61,0:29:21.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Din cauza voastră, \Nam ajuns și eu un om căutat.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:23.03,0:29:23.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:23.87,0:29:25.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vrei să vii cu noi?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:25.79,0:29:29.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă o vei face, imperiul nu va \Nputea ajunge cu ușurință la tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:29.66,0:29:31.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sună bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:32.58,0:29:35.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar toată bătaia asta de \Ncap pentru acest vierme!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:39.38,0:29:40.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prințesă,
Dialogue: 99,0:29:40.76,0:29:42.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,ce naiba te-a apucat?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:42.34,0:29:44.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Termină cu prostiile.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:44.80,0:29:45.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poftim?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:46.76,0:29:50.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poate sunt doar un vierme!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:54.02,0:29:58.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar nu te voi lăsa \Ns-o insulți pe Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:00.45,0:30:03.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Foarte interesant! \NArată-mi de ce ești în stare!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:18.76,0:30:20.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ți-a ajuns?
Dialogue: 99,0:30:20.26,0:30:22.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta e o luptă între bărbați!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:22.01,0:30:23.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te voi ucide!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:26.26,0:30:29.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se pare că e doar gura de tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:30.85,0:30:31.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:31.77,0:30:33.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai în spate, Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:33.35,0:30:34.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O fată nu ar trebui să intervină!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:34.90,0:30:38.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ăsta este un duel între bărbați!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:39.40,0:30:40.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya...
Dialogue: 99,0:30:40.94,0:30:43.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Încă mai dai din \Ngura aia spurcată?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:48.26,0:31:50.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acceptă-ți înfrângerea.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:54.27,0:31:55.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nici gând!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:57.40,0:31:59.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar vrei să mori?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:59.77,0:32:02.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taci!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:42.11,0:32:44.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:45.78,0:32:48.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Încă respiră.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:48.20,0:32:50.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Folosește-ți puterea, Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:50.95,0:32:53.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu am mai folosit această \Ntehnică până acum,
Dialogue: 99,0:32:53.03,0:32:57.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,dar doar cei cu sânge \Nregal o pot folosi.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:02.96,0:33:06.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alertă! Intrusul a evadat!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:06.76,0:33:09.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și se pare că a răpit-o \Npe prințesa Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:09.63,0:33:13.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Toți soldații din palat sunt \Nîn stare de alertă maximă!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:28.69,0:33:30.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Noi îi vom ține ocupați.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:41.17,0:33:44.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haide să ne distrăm un pic \Ncât timp îi ținem pe loc.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:44.13,0:33:45.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să ne dezlănțuim.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:12.57,0:34:14.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu te voi lăsa să mori.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:21.50,0:34:23.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu te voi lăsa să mori!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:43.10,0:34:44.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Au, au, auci...
Dialogue: 99,0:34:50.44,0:34:53.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rănile mele! Rănile \Nmele au dispărut!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:08.63,0:35:10.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îți mulțumesc, Kahm.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:17.26,0:35:18.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce s-a întâmplat, Kahm?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:20.89,0:35:22.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt doar puțin obosită.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:24.98,0:35:27.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-ți face griji. Nu sunt beată!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:29.65,0:35:32.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar ține-te de \Nmine și vei fi bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:35.40,0:35:37.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, nu ți-am spus \Nsă mă apuci de acolo!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:41.08,0:35:42.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba! Suntem urmăriți!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:49.67,0:35:51.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ajutor!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:51.34,0:35:53.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dă-mi mâna, Prințesă! \NTe voi salva eu!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:54.72,0:35:55.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, serios?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:07.85,0:36:10.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hangarul e imediat după asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:11.23,0:36:12.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A fost floare la ureche.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:28.37,0:36:29.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Auci.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:30.29,0:36:31.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:31.34,0:36:31.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:39.47,0:36:40.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aici!
Dialogue: 99,0:36:42.68,0:36:43.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să pornim motoarele!
Dialogue: 99,0:36:52.57,0:36:54.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și să-i dăm bice!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:13.34,0:37:15.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce ar trebui să facem acum?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:22.80,0:37:24.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă așteptăm ordinele!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:28.35,0:37:30.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă mulțumim, Battia, Geobaldi!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:31.15,0:37:32.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu e nevoie să ne mulțumiți.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:32.77,0:37:34.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uite-l pe bătrânul tău drag.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:40.95,0:37:42.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, nu! Acela e Progres?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:44.07,0:37:45.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pariez că e roșu de furie.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:46.33,0:37:47.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pregătiți-vă de atac!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:48.33,0:37:50.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Suntem foarte aproape de țintă.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:50.41,0:37:52.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă îi vom lovi prea puternic,
Dialogue: 99,0:37:52.08,0:37:54.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nava prințesei Kahm va fi distrusă.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:55.84,0:37:58.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Atunci loviți-le motoarele. \NAsigurați-vă că nu vor mai putea zbura.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:59.30,0:38:00.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Foc!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:07.22,0:38:08.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Contraatacăm și noi?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:08.77,0:38:09.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu încă. E prea devreme.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:16.90,0:38:19.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Către toate navele:
Dialogue: 99,0:38:19.07,0:38:22.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Înconjurați navele \Nlui Kahm și Geobaldi!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:32.16,0:38:33.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E de rău.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:33.33,0:38:35.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu putem sări în \Nhiperspațiu ca să scăpăm?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:35.08,0:38:35.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:35.88,0:38:37.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Încă suntem în câmpul \Ngravitațional al planetei.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:37.80,0:38:40.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și nici măcar nu am \Nreparat zonele avariate.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:40.01,0:38:41.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu vom putea porni motoarele!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:41.63,0:38:42.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Șefule!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:42.93,0:38:44.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Luați-o ușor!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:44.68,0:38:46.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Suntem gata de plecare?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:46.47,0:38:49.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, totul este pregătit.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:49.39,0:38:50.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În regulă!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:52.52,0:38:54.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce spuneți de asta? \NNu veți mai putea zbura acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:01.90,0:39:02.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Câte nave!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:07.37,0:39:10.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În regulă! \NSă întoarcem nava!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:10.49,0:39:13.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vom merge direct \Nspre nava lui Progres!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:13.04,0:39:14.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:23.84,0:39:26.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce naiba încearcă să \Nfacă idiotul de Geobaldi?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:26.14,0:39:27.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E complet descoperit acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:27.93,0:39:30.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trageți cu tunul principal \Nla putere maximă!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:31.14,0:39:32.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta e mult prea periculos!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:38.15,0:39:41.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce naiba încercați să faceți? \NV-ați pierdut cumva mințile?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:42.48,0:39:43.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai grijă de tine, Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:43.69,0:39:44.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, vierme...
Dialogue: 99,0:39:45.99,0:39:47.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O lăsăm pe prințesă în seama ta.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:47.91,0:39:49.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Geobaldi.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:51.04,0:39:52.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îi avem în vizor!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:53.00,0:39:55.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-a zis cu tine, Geobaldi.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:16.23,0:40:17.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Foc!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:22.61,0:40:23.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce s-a întâmplat?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:25.19,0:40:27.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Armura navei noastre se sfărâmă!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:27.61,0:40:29.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poftim?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:45.09,0:40:46.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce se petrece?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:51.47,0:40:54.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Armurile tuturor navelor \Nnoastre se sfărâmă!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:57.52,0:40:58.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu se poate!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:59.44,0:41:01.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am reușit, Căpitane!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:02.36,0:41:03.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu se poate!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:03.02,0:41:05.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta a fost opera lui Geobaldi?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:15.45,0:41:16.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Avem ținta în vizor!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:17.33,0:41:18.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Foc!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:49.70,0:41:53.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Se pare că totul \Na fost în zadar.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:54.03,0:41:57.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nava prințesei își continuă \Nevadarea alături de nava lui Geobaldi.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:57.83,0:42:01.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu vom continua să-i urmărim \Nca s-o aducem înapoi pe prințesă?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:01.42,0:42:02.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă așteptăm ordinele!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:02.37,0:42:03.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lăsați-i.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:57.93,0:43:00.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să nu-i deranjăm! \NSă nu-i deranjăm!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:02.73,0:43:03.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să nu-i deranjăm!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:06.94,0:43:07.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te rog să fii blând.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:07.90,0:43:10.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se pare că vom reuși să \Nsalvăm planeta Pământ.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:16.87,0:43:19.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Un bărbat? Pe naiba!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:22.70,0:43:25.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, pari puțin supărată.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:25.08,0:43:27.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar taci și bea asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:29.09,0:43:30.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești destul de sălbatică astăzi.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:30.59,0:43:32.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sălbatică? Așa, și? \NAi vreo problemă cu asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:34.30,0:43:36.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te face foarte sexy.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:48.73,0:43:50.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Săruturile sunt dulci.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:51.48,0:43:52.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:52.78,0:43:53.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ia-mă ușor!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:54.49,0:43:57.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să nu-i deranjăm! \NSă nu-i deranjăm!
Dialogue: 99,0:47:49.22,0:47:52.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să nu-i deranjăm! \NSă nu-i deranjăm!
